<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n80147" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάχετος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾰ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παχύς</span>
			, <i>thick, massive</i>, twice in <i><span class="en">
				Od.
			</span></i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λάβε δίσκον μείζονα καὶ πάχετον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					8.187
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάχετος δ᾽ ἦν ἠΰτε κίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					23.191
				</span></i>
			. (Wrongly expld. by <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> and <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				656.53
			</span></i> as sync. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παχύτερον</span> ;
			for the termination cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιμήκετος</span>.) </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>tight</i>, of a knot or ligature, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				2.110
			</span></i> : neut. as Adv., <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Cord.</u>
				6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in later 
				Ep.
			 as neut. Subst., 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάχος</span>
			, <i>thickness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				385
			</span></i> (dub.), <i><span class="en">
				387
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				465
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Opp.
				<u>H.</u>
				4.535
			</span></i> codd. (Oxyt. in codd. <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
			</span></i> ll. cc.)</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
